scroll binding power~
這是古老城市：迷斯卓諾的其中一項偉大魔法物品。精靈大法師們為了使武器更加
地強大，以用來抵抗即將到來的邪惡，而準備了這個捲軸。但他們已經被擊敗，而
捲軸則被班恩奪取，用來幫助他突破被束縛在古老城市之下的禁錮。
This is one of the last great artifacts of the ancient city of Myth Drannor.
The elven archmages had prepared it in order to help create a weapon powerful
enough to fight the evil that was coming, but they were defeated first and the
scroll was taken by Bane in order to help him break the bonds that held him
beneath the ancient city.
~

